<title>SINGAPORE: Resources Dev wins S$86.4 mln land tender.</title>
<headline>Resources Dev wins S$86.4 mln land tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building supplies company Resources Development Corp Ltd said on Tuesday it won a tender for a Singapore property at a tender price of Singapore $86.4 million through a wholly-owned unit.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement building on the 2,865 sq metre site -- which previously housed the U.S. Embassy -- would cost it an estimated S$13.5 million in development charges.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
